{"unit_id":"songzhiyin__dsh-local-model#card-zh","repo":"songzhiyin/dsh-local-model","commit":"9f48779ba1c7698bd8d40f548d6e882df09639c1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-model 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的本地模型适配插件。它向模型设置注册 local provider，并同时支持 OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completions 接口和 Ollama 原生聊天接口。插件可发现端点提供的模型，将 DSH 消息、工具定义和流式响应转换为对应协议，也能把部分以文本 JSON 输出的工具调用恢复成结构化调用。设置页附带连接测试卡片，可填写端点并查看模型列表。适合希望在 DSH 中使用 Ollama、LM Studio、llama.cpp 或其他兼容服务的用户；模型服务需由用户在本机或网络中运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:613-804","lib/client.js:159-230"]}
{"unit_id":"songzhiyin__dsh-local-model#card-en","repo":"songzhiyin/dsh-local-model","commit":"9f48779ba1c7698bd8d40f548d6e882df09639c1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-local-model adds a local model provider to DSH. It supports OpenAI-compatible and Ollama chat, discovers models, converts messages and tool calls, and streams responses. A settings card tests endpoints and lists models. Use it with a local Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, or compatible service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:613-804","lib/client.js:159-230"]}
