{"unit_id":"songzhiyin__dsh-local-model#feature-1","repo":"songzhiyin/dsh-local-model","commit":"9f48779ba1c7698bd8d40f548d6e882df09639c1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-model 的功能「OpenAI 兼容模型接入」：把 DSH 消息和工具定义转换为 Chat Completions 请求并流式读取 SSE 响应，供 local provider 使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:97-159","lib/index.js:703-739"]}
